### Edit

If you want the previous _infoWindow_ to be closed to open a new one, as it works in the example with `@ViewChild(MapInfoWindow) infoWindow: MapInfoWindow;`, you can keep a field in the class to store the last _infoWindow_ opened (without the _@ViewChild(MapInfoWindow)_), so you can close it before opening the next one.

```lang-ts
infoWindow: MapInfoWindow;

openInfoWindow(marker: MapMarker, infoWindow: MapInfoWindow) {
	this.infoWindow?.close();
	this.infoWindow = infoWindow;
	this.infoWindow.open(marker);
}
```

